{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o130","title":"华歆少以高行显名，避西京之乱，与郑泰等六七人间步出武关","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-21def6d239ae4c14f667","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"华歆少以高行显名，避西京之乱，与郑泰等六七人间步出武关","evidence":["zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d3b4a1c00e64bf7811a4","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"道遇一丈夫独行愿得俱，歆以为无故受人不知其义，众不忍卒与俱行","evidence":["zhonghua-q-bce56055e463504d5cbd"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-3d41fab2c06a49df73b9","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"此丈夫中道堕井，皆欲弃之；歆曰弃之不义，相率共还出之而后别去，众乃大义之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-708e408de9ea52c204e4"]},{"id":"rensu-a-470030c03896df63badf","label":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","text":"郑泰脱身自武关走，东归","evidence":["rensu-q-92e5656e119dc80c6db9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"避乱出关者；持不可之议者；主张救出同行者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74","zhonghua-q-bce56055e463504d5cbd","zhonghua-q-708e408de9ea52c204e4"]},{"person":"wudi-p0067","role":"同避乱者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74","zhonghua-q-bce56055e463504d5cbd","zhonghua-q-708e408de9ea52c204e4"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74","source_order":[13,173,12],"order":2885}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0067","name":"郑泰","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-92e5656e119dc80c6db9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c172c36c6f19e1d68402","layer":"pei","quote":"泰脱身自武关走，东归","attribution":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-011440cf6742ee5cb197","start":1148,"end":1158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-17053fc1ac28f36cad74","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-70a15ac310ef1a8a887a","layer":"pei","quote":"歆，少以高行显名。避西京之乱，与同志郑泰等六七人，间步出武关。","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3b93e78d21edff5b4d12","start":12,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-708e408de9ea52c204e4","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-70a15ac310ef1a8a887a","layer":"pei","quote":"此丈夫中道堕井，皆欲弃之。歆曰：‘已与俱矣，弃之不义。’相率共还，出之，而后别去。众乃大义之。”","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3b93e78d21edff5b4d12","start":122,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-bce56055e463504d5cbd","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-70a15ac310ef1a8a887a","layer":"pei","quote":"道遇一丈夫独行，愿得俱，皆哀欲许之。歆独曰：‘不可。今已在危险之中，祸福患害，义犹一也。无故受人，不知其义。既已受之，若有进退，可中弃乎！’众不忍，卒与俱行。","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3b93e78d21edff5b4d12","start":43,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
